    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: August 2026</p>
    <p>Grand River Stump Removal operates as a local digital marketing and lead-generation portal for property maintenance and tree care professionals inside Ontario, Canada.</p>
    
    <h2>1. Data Collection & Processing Consent</h2>
    <p>We collect standard personal contact info (Name, Phone Number, and Geographic Region) provided voluntarily via our web quote forms. Under PIPEDA guidelines, users explicitly authorize us to pass these baseline job scopes down to verified local independent technicians solely to process project estimations.</p>
    
    <h2>2. Protection Obligations</h2>
    <p>We do not store information for email distribution, cold-marketing scripts, or unrelated broker databases. Data is safely expunged once a local operator accepts or rejects the technical service call details.</p>
    
